  "content_raw": "<!-- wp:html -->\n<!-- content-architecture-2026:speaking -->\n<style>\n.kk-r9-pack :where(p, li)::first-letter {\n  initial-letter: normal !important;\n  font-size: inherit !important;\n  font-weight: inherit !important;\n  float: none !important;\n  margin: 0 !important;\n  line-height: inherit !important;\n  color: inherit !important;\n  background: transparent !important;\n}\n.kk-r9-pack .aurora-button,\n.kk-r9-pack a.aurora-button {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: 0.7rem 1.1rem;\n  border: 1px solid #171310;\n  border-radius: 2px;\n  background: #171310;\n  color: #efe6d2 !important;\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n}\n.kk-r9-pack .aurora-button:hover,\n.kk-r9-pack a.aurora-button:hover {\n  background: #d94a1f;\n  border-color: #d94a1f;\n  color: #efe6d2 !important;\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n}\n.kk-r9-pack .aurora-card,\n.kk-r9-pack .aurora-media-card {\n  border-radius: 2px !important;\n  box-shadow: none !important;\n}\n</style>\n<div class=\"kk-page kk-r9-pack\">\n<section class=\"aurora-proof-section\">\n  <p class=\"aurora-section-kicker\">Speaking</p>\n  <h2 class=\"aurora-display-heading\">AI keynotes that make the room braver.</h2>\n  <p class=\"aurora-page-lead\">I help audiences meet AI with courage, taste, and usable imagination. The talks mix field stories, live demos, creative rebellion, practical workflows, and the hard questions about power, trust, authorship, memory, and what we refuse to automate.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"aurora-proof-section\">\n  <p class=\"aurora-section-kicker\">Formats</p>\n  <div class=\"aurora-proof-grid\">\n    <article class=\"aurora-card\">\n      <h3>Keynotes</h3>\n      <p>High-energy, story-rich talks for conferences, leadership rooms, creative teams, schools, and public-interest technology gatherings.</p>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-card\">\n      <h3>Workshops</h3>\n      <p>Hands-on labs where people build real workflows, test tools, and leave with language they can use.</p>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-card\">\n      <h3>Executive briefings</h3>\n      <p>Plainspoken AI sensemaking for leaders who need useful strategy without hype theatre.</p>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-card\">\n      <h3>Hosting and moderation</h3>\n      <p>Warm, sharp facilitation for panels, salons, podcasts, livestreams, and rooms with too many acronyms.</p>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"aurora-proof-section\">\n  <p class=\"aurora-section-kicker\">Signature topics</p>\n  <div class=\"aurora-proof-grid\">\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.bothhandsfull.com/\">\n        <img src=\"https://www.bothhandsfull.com/opengraph-image?46af5f0ff830fe03\" alt=\"Both Hands Full keynote portal graphic\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Both Hands Full</h3>\n          <p>How to stay human, creative, and useful while AI makes everything faster.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.punkrockai.com/\">\n        <img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.punkrockai.com/public/photos/michelle-diamond/195.webp?w=1200&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"Punk Rock AI portal preview\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Punk Rock AI</h3>\n          <p>A culture-first way to use powerful tools without becoming obedient to them.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"http://developinganaimindset.com/\">\n        <img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/kriskrug.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/AI-Immortality-w-Guy-Kawasaki.png?fit=1200%2C604&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"Developing an AI Mindset keynote graphic with Guy Kawasaki\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Developing an AI mindset</h3>\n          <p>From tool panic to practice: how people learn, adapt, and keep judgment in the loop.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"aurora-media-card\">\n      <a href=\"/responsible-ai-professional/\">\n        <img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/kriskrug.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/kk-laSalle-both-hands-full-10-scaled.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"Kris Krug speaking at LaSalle College Vancouver\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Responsible AI</h3>\n          <p>Bias, privacy, provenance, labor, trust, authenticity, and what responsible deployment means in practice.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"aurora-proof-section\">\n  <div class=\"aurora-card\">\n    <h2>Book Kris for a keynote</h2>\n    <p>Send the audience, date, location, format, and the question your room is trying to answer. I will help shape the talk to the people in front of us.</p>\n    <p><a class=\"aurora-button\" href=\"/contact/\">Start a booking conversation</a></p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n"
